          "meaning_en": "Hand-span (thumb tip to little finger outstretched)",
          "meaning_hi": "बित्ता (अंगूठे से कनिष्ठिका तक)",
          "usage": "Standard unit for measuring pottery diameters, basket depths, and bamboo tubes."
