          "term": "Khumpi",
          "meaning_en": "Cubit (elbow to the tip of the middle finger)",
          "meaning_hi": "हाथ (कोहनी से मध्यमा उँगली की नोक तक)",
          "usage": "Measuring woven cloth bolts (kachon) and timber planks."
        },
        {
          "term": "Phei akha-zat",
          "meaning_en": "Pace / Human Stride",
